  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "20. Strategic Reserves",
    "ruleNumber": "20.03",
    "summary": "Strategic reserves units reach the battlefield by ingress move (see 20.04), which by default they may do only starting in battle round two. When the third battle round ends, unless a rule states otherwise, every strategic reserves unit that has never made an ingress move is destroyed, except units inside TRANSPORTS that themselves arrived by ingress at some point in the battle, and repositioned units (20.02). Any rule about a unit arriving “as Reinforcements” refers to a unit that arrived by ingress.",
